      {
       "t": "prose",
       "md": "The model behind [Measurement Error Attenuation](note:measurement-error-attenuation). Place that view, not this note."
      },
      {
       "t": "prose",
       "md": "- **Model.** [Classical Measurement Error](note:classical-measurement-error): observed $x = x^{*} + u$, so $\\operatorname{plim}\\hat\\beta = \\lambda\\beta$ with $\\lambda = S/(S + \\sigma_u^2)$, $S = \\mathrm{Var}(x^{*})$.\n- **Tests.** Exact arithmetic: $0.2 \\times 4/5 = 0.16$; $0.2 \\times 4/8 = 0.1$."
      }
     ],
